properties.description:
Wire inground pool 
-Install a 60-Amp 230 Volt feed to pool equipment (75');
-Furnish and install double timer pool panel;
-Install wire for Filter pump;
-Install wire for Pool light with switch at the pool equipment;
-Install wire 230 Volt Heat Pump;
-Install Wire for Salt Generator;
-Install bonding loop around pool perimeter
-Core drill the electrical room floor slab to run conduit under a corner section of the slab .
As per 2014 nec

GM-2022-001031

